2 CONT >“I still consider a ‘Canaanite’ origin of Yaba and Atalya at least possible. Whether the two queens were really associated with the royal house of Judah is uncertain, and an Israelite or Phoenician origin should be considered as 
2 CONC well.” ([[https://books.google.com/books?id=bF_bAgAAQBAJ&pg=PA183&lpg=PA183&dq=sargon+ii+Ataly%C4%81&source=bl&ots=CQO4HwY8aZ&sig=L7Pyn694P7zB8URGABYO3TFLjmg&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwi-s97ti-jaAhUCyYMKHevpAzYQ6AEIRTAC#v=onepage&q=Ata
2 CONC ly%C4%81&f=false Frahm, 188]). 
2 CONT
