2 CONT
2 CONT The family of Chrosov ou Chosroes II (tg) d'ARMÉNIE and ..
2 CONT
2 CONT [128925] ARMÉNIE (d'), Chrosov ou Chosroes II (tg) (Trdat ou Tiridates (tg) II & .. [128924]), roi d'Arménie, born about 230, died 297
2 CONT
