2 CONT Eudoric's father was Flavius Valentinian of Rome III and her mother was Licinia Eudoxia.  Her paternal grandparents were Constantine Gratianus of Rome III and Galla Placida Rome; her maternal grandparents were Theodosus Ii and Ath
2 CONC enais Eudocia. She had a sister named Galla.  She was the older of the two children. She had a half-brother named Hunneric.
