2 CONT The family of Hamazasp III MAMMIKONIDÈS and ..
2 CONT
2 CONT [128938] MAMMIKONIDÈS, Hamazasp III (Dawith ou David (tg) & .. [128937]), curopalate d'Arménie, born about 610, died 658
