1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Latavri of Tao-Klarjeti
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Latavri (Georgian: ლატავრი) was a Georgian royal princess of the Bagrationi dynasty of Tao-Klarjeti branch.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a daughter of Adarnase I of Tao-Klarjeti and sister of King Ashot I of Iberia.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Prince Juansher, son of Prince Archil of Kakheti. Juansher’s mother was initially opposed to the marriage. According to the chronicle:
2 CONT
2 CONT "And this Juansher married Bagrationi, daughter of Adarnase, named Latavri, and mother of his blamed him for marrying her, but she did not know well that they are the relatives of Prophet David who was the lord. And when she saw a
2 CONC  wife of her son, loved her and blessed her."
