2 CONT # The Political and Dynastic History of the Iranian World, C.E. Bosworth, The Cambridge History of Iran, Vol. 5, ed. John Andrew Boyle, (Cambridge University Press, 1968), 169-170.
2 CONT # Ibn Al-Athir 2010, p. 120.
2 CONT
