2 CONT # Toumanoff 1949–1951, p. 181.
2 CONT # Peacock 2006, p. 130.
2 CONT # Ibn Al-Athir, in Richards 2010, p. 244.
2 CONT # The Chronicle of A Hundred Years, in Metreveli 2008, p. 537.
2 CONT # Ibn Al-Athir, in Richards 2010, pp. 244, 270.
2 CONT # The Chronicle of A Hundred Years, in Metreveli 2008, p. 535.
2 CONT # Ibn Al-Athir, in Richards 2010, pp. 244–245.
2 CONT
