2 CONT # Vahan M. Kurkjian (2005-04-05). "A History of Armenia". ''Website''. Bill Thayer. Retrieved 2009-07-25.
2 CONT # Vahram (2008-09-10). "Chronicle". ''Text Archive''. Internet Archive. Retrieved 2009-07-26.
2 CONT # Engel, Pál. ''The Realm of St Stephen: A History of Medieval Hungary, 895–1526.''
2 CONT # Smbat Sparapet (Sempad the Constable) (2005). "Chronicle". ''History Workshop: Armenian Historical Sources of the 5th–15th Centuries (Selected Works)''. Robert Bedrosian’s Homepage. Retrieved 2009-07-26.
2 CONT # Charles Cawley (2009-04-01). "Kings of Armenia (Cilician Armenia) (Family of Hethum)". ''Medieval Lands''. Foundation of Medieval Genealogy. Retrieved 2009-07-26.
2 CONT
