2 CONT 1.         '''HUGUES''' (-1264 or after).  The Lignages d'Outremer name "Hue" as son of "Bertran"[282].  Bailli of Cyprus 1229/1264.  "Hue de Gibellet filius Bertrandi de Gibellet" granted property to the Knights Hospitallers by c
2 CONC harter dated 14 Apr 1259[283].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' as her second husband, MARIE Porcelet, '''widow''' of LINARD de Baphe, daughter of GUILLAUME Porcelet & his wife Marguerite de Beirut.  The Lignages d'Outremer records that "Guillaume Porcelet" & his wife had four children
2 CONC  "Renaut et Bertran et hue et Marie", of whom "Marie fu feme de Linart de Baphe" after whose death she married "Hue de Gibellet, et ot I fiz Bertran pere de cestui Bertheleme"[284].  The Lignages d'Outremer name "Marie Porcelete" 
2 CONC as wife of "Hue" son of "Bertran"[285].  Another manuscript of the Lignages names her "Marie, la fille Guilliaume Porcelet, qui fu feme de Liurart de Baphe"[286].  1248.  
2 CONT
2 CONT   Hugues & his wife had one child: 
