2 CONT 1.         DJOFFREY (-[15 Jan 1261/14 Jan 1262]).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  Lord of Saravantikar.  The Chronicle attributed to King Hethum II records that "Chawri the lord of Sa
2 CONC rvandikar" died in [15 Jan 1261/14 Jan 1262], later in the year than the marriage of his son Kostandin which is recorded in the earlier part of the same passage[1239].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly ALIX, daughter of ---.  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly KYR ANNA of Lampron, daughter of KOSTANDIN Lord of Lampron & his wife Stephanie of Barbaron (-after 1274).  She and her husband are named in the Tetraevangelium of her brother Oshin, dated to 1274, with their chil
2 CONC dren Kostand, Oshin and Smbat[1240].  
2 CONT
