2 CONT 2.         HETHUM (-[1294]).  He succeeded his brother as Lord of Korikos.  The Chronicle attributed to King Hethum II record "Hetum lord of Kurikos and his brother Oshin lord of Kanch" were among the leaders of a conspiracy again
2 CONC st King Hethum in [7 Jan 1293/6 Jan 1294][1037].  The Chronicle attributed to Hethum II King of Armenia records the death in 1294 of "paron Hetum lord of Kurikos and his brother paron Oshin"[1038].  
2 CONT
