2 CONT
2 CONT Bondan Kajawan or Dyah Lembu Peteng was the son of Brawijaya (Batara Wijaya), the last king of the Majapahit Kingdom , and Wandan Kuning, a lady-in-waiting who usually served the king's consort, namely Putri Campa.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Dyah Lembu Peteng or Bondan Kajawan married Dyah Nawangsih and has three sons and daughters:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Dyah Dukuh / Ki Ageng Wanasaba
2 CONT * Dyah Depok / Ki Getas Pandawa
2 CONT * Rara Kasihan / Nyai Ageng groans
2 CONT * Ki Ageng Wanasaba has sons and daughters:
2 CONT * Ki Ageng Pandanaran / Prince Made Pandan married Nyai Ageng Pandanaran with sons and daughters:
2 CONT ** Ki Ageng Pakringan is married to Rara Janten with daughters:
2 CONT *** Nyai Ageng Laweh
2 CONT **** Nyai Manggar
2 CONT ***Ki Ageng Saba married Nyai Ageng Saba with sons and daughters:
2 CONT **** Ki Juru Martani / Patih Mandaraka married Ratu Mas Banten with sons:
2 CONT ***** Prince Mandura
2 CONT ***** Prince Kiting
2 CONT ***** Prince Jagabaya
2 CONT **** Nyai Sabinah married Ki Ageng Pakarahan
2 CONT **Ki Getas Pandawa had sons and daughters:
2 CONT *** Ki Ageng Sela / Kyai Abdurrahman married Nyai Bicak (Nyai Ageng Sela) with a son
2 CONT **** Nyai Ageng Lurung Tengah
2 CONT ***** Nyai Ageng Saba
2 CONT ***** Nyai Ageng Bangsri
2 CONT ***** Nyai Ageng Jati
2 CONT ***** Nyai Ageng Patanen
2 CONT ***** Nyai Ageng Pakisdadu.
2 CONT ****** Ki Ageng Anis / Ki Ageng Laweyan married Nyai Ageng Laweyan with sons:
2 CONT ** Ki Ageng Pakarahan married Nyai Sabinah
2 CONT * Nyai Ageng Ngerang has sons and daughters:
2 CONT * Rara Kinasih / Nyai Bicak / Nyai Ageng Sela married Ki Ageng Sela
2 CONT * Ki Ageng Ngerang II has sons:
2 CONT * Ki Ageng Ngerang III is married to Dyah Ayu Panengah and has the following sons:
2 CONT * Ki Ageng Panjawi
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Dikisahkan, Brawijaya memiliki anak bernama Bondan Kejawan/ Lembupeteng Tarub , yang tidak diakuinya. Bondan Kejawan berputra Ki Getas Pandawa. Kemudian Ki Getas Pandawa berputra Ki Ageng Sela.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ki Ageng Sela berputra beberapa orang putri dan seorang putra bergelar Ki Ageng Ngenis. Ki Ageng Ngenis berputra Ki Ageng Pemanahan, penguasa pertama Mataram.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''DECEASED'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Bondan Kedjawen / Boendan Kedjawen / Bundhan kajawan / / Lembu Peteng / Ki Ageng Tarub II
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Raden Bondan Kedjawen alias / Lembupeteng Tarub adalah putra dari Kertabumi alias Brawijaya V alias Raden Alit /alis Angkowidjoyo.
