2 CONT 6.         JEANNE of Sicily (-Mar 1323).  The Chronique du Royaume de la Petite Arménie of Constable Sempad records the marriage in [2 Jan 1316/31 Dec 1316] of King Oshin and "la fille de [Philippe de Tarente], frère de Robert roi
2 CONC  de Sicile"[919].  She adopted the name EIRENE.  She was forced to marry her second husband after the death of her first.  
2 CONT
