2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly (1320) as his second wife, OSHIN Lord of Korikos Regent of Armenia, son of HETHUM “the Historian” Lord of Korikos & his wife Isabelle Ibelin (-murdered 26 Jan 1329).  
