2 CONT
2 CONT Ronald Grigor Suny, The Making of the Georgian Nation: 2nd edition (December 1994), Indiana University Press, ISBN 0-253-20915-3
2 CONT
2 CONT T'oma Metsobeli's History of Tamerlane and His Successors
2 CONT
