1 NAME Rajasawardhana Sang Sinagara (1451-1453)
1 NAME Rajasawardhana Sang Sinagara //
2 GIVN Rajasawardhana Sang Sinagara
2 SURN
1 SEX M
1 OCCU Bhre Keling
2 DATE 1451
2 PLAC Keling / Kahuripan
2 ADDR
