1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Anne de Lusignan''', ''Princess of Cyprus'' was born on 24 September 1418.1
2 CONT She was the daughter of Janus de Lusignan, King of Cyprus and Charlotte de Bourbon-La Marche.2
2 CONT She married Ludovico I Duca di Savoia, son of Amadeo VIII Duca di Savoia and Marie de Valois-Bourgogne, on 1 November 1433 at Chambéry, France.2
2 CONT She died on 11 November 1462 at age 44 at Geneva, Switzerland.1
