2 CONC an 'All Mirza, his brothers, Ibrahim Mirza and Isma'il Mirza, and their mother, were imprisoned in the fort of Istakhr in Fars.] ref: https://archive.org/stream/HistoryOfShahIsmailSafawi-GhulamSarwar/119900259-History-of-Shah-Isma
