1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mesih Pasha''' or Misac Pasha[1] (died November 1501) was an Ottoman statesman of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byzantine_Greeks Byzantine Greek] origin, being a nephew of the last Roman emperor, [https://www.g
2 CONC eni.com/people/Constantine-XI-Palaiologos-last-byzantine-emperor/6000000009965401953 '''Constantine XI Palaiologos''']. He served as [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kapudan_Pasha Kapudan Pasha] of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki
2 CONC /Ottoman_Navy Ottoman Navy] and was [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Ottoman_grand_viziers Grand Vizier] of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ottoman_Empire Ottoman Empire] in 1501. 
