2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Tamar (Georgian: თამარი) (died 1556) was a Georgian princess of the royal Bagrationi dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tamar was titled as "დედოფალთ დედოფალი თამარ" (dedopalt dedopali tamar) "Tamar the Queen of Queens".
2 CONT
2 CONT Tamar was a daughter of King Bagrat III of Imereti.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tamar married King Luarsab I of Kartli and had 8 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Unknown son (died 1536)
2 CONT
2 CONT Unknown daughter
2 CONT
2 CONT Unknown daughter
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander
2 CONT
2 CONT Levan
2 CONT
2 CONT Vakhtang (died 1634)
2 CONT
2 CONT Simon I, King of Kartli
2 CONT
2 CONT David XI, King of Kartli
