2 CONT
2 CONT The Aq-Quyvinlu dynasty extinguished on "the death of Sultan Murad.
2 CONT
2 CONT [On receipt of this news, Ahmad Beg set out to crush the rebellion. The armies  met at Ulang-i-Kaniz near Isfahan " on Rabi' II, 1 8, 903 "/Dec. 14, 1497. Ahmad Beg  lost his life in the battle, and Ayba Sultan proceeded to Qum, w
2 CONC here he road the Khutba in the name of Sultan Murad ibn Ya'qub Mlrza, who had been living in Shirwan since  the death of his brother Baysunqur Mlrza in 898/1493. ] ref page 107 of https://archive.org/stream/HistoryOfShahIsmailSafa
