1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Teispes (675-640 BC) (in Old Persian Chishpish) was the son of Achaemenes and a King of Persia. His name was given in Greek as ?e?sp??. Teispes captured the Elamite city of Anšan and called himself "King of the City of Anšan", a f
1 CONC irst step that would lead to the rise of the Persian Empire.
1 CONT
