1 CONT TV series
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Alexander the Great (1968), TV series, starring William Shatner as Alexander, directed by Phil Karlson.
1 CONT     * Alexander Senki (1997), Anime / TV series, Toshihiko Seki as Alexander, directed by Yoshinori Kanemori. Also known as Alexander (International: English title); Reign: The Conqueror (USA).
1 CONT     * The 1996 miniseries Gulliver's Travels, starring Ted Danson, featured a visit from Alexander the Great.
